(text "PLANTER / XIAO C6-S3 CARRIER - REV B" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "67ca1bea-1f32-5756-b2b8-97da0e3cbb8d"))
(text "01  PROTECTED BATTERY INPUT" (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02010a75-e0b1-50f8-8ffd-ba9d141abfd0"))
(text "JP1: fitted removable shunt. All battery loads are downstream.\nPWR_FLAG declares the external pack supply; it is not a component." (at 20 65 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e6893f48-6191-5d7e-9b78-2278a2d512a6"))
(text "External 1S protection PCB stays with the cell.\nCell + / - to B+ / B-. P+ to J1.1; P- to J1.2.\nDo not join B- to system GND. Confirm common-port charging." (at 20 78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f11a297-9b60-508d-97c6-44bea9e2521d"))
(text "02  BATTERY MEASUREMENT" (at 20 94 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "23a2c841-dd88-52f7-a8d5-454a503b5411"))
(text "BOTH 200k resistors fitted. 4.2V pack -> 2.1V ADC.\nC1 at U1. Neither XIAO has an onboard A0 divider." (at 20 146 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5a7c6d46-5ad6-5fbd-a61d-1204dd8c6f08"))
(text "03  SHARED PERIPHERAL POWER" (at 20 163 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb5bf676-1b17-5431-a3a1-51b9251a2948"))
(text "LOW = on. R1 holds Q1 off at reset. Q1: G=1, S=2, D=3.\nSource is the lower pin here (3V3); drain is 3V3_SW.\nFirmware must not drive an unpowered peripheral high." (at 20 197 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9762f5d-0d5c-580e-b529-03c73914eff5"))
(text "04  XIAO MODULE (SOCKETED, C6 OR S3)" (at 213 30 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c4d0384-6d53-58ba-ba5b-6eb5e9a11f40"))
(text "Captured by pad label. GPIO per chip shown on each pin.\nVBUS NC: the XIAO USB-C is the only charger.\nJ4: short strain-relieved leads to the XIAO underside BAT+/BAT-.\nD6 = UART0 TX on both chips, so BUSY moved to D7 (RX).\nD6/D9 spare: probe at the socketed XIAO castellations." (at 213 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "170a4a4c-c95a-51fa-bf43-7cbd491fe0a5"))
(text "05  PROBE / FILTER" (at 213 127 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d34e5aad-d121-52c2-86fd-834741e0bb17"))
(text "06  DISPLAY / LOCAL BYPASS" (at 327 127 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "59379395-0516-5df6-b0f9-f44d072b58eb"))
(text "J3 mates the WeAct 1.54-inch 2x4 header from the board underside.\nPin 1 BUSY, 2 RES, 3 D/C, 4 CS, 5 SCL, 6 SDA, 7 GND, 8 VCC." (at 213 202 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04217606-b1ce-52c7-8bb8-f4b6ad8fc031"))
(text "07  TEST POINTS" (at 20 212 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce6d18d1-81fe-5c04-86ff-fbac24912f87"))
(text "PROTOTYPE PCB - NOT YET A FIRST-ARTICLE-VERIFIED RELEASE" (at 20 243 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7ab526ca-0fd9-5e87-80e8-7406ccd17d58"))
(text "Board: 50.12 x 32.60mm, WeAct 1.54-inch module outline and M2.5 hole pattern (44.52 x 27.00mm).\nAntenna end of the XIAO is over a copper keep-out. See README.md for stack-up and first-article gates." (at 20 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60f61f86-8a88-5573-8b7e-3d9e4887e471"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
